        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Matte Black Revena Offset 12 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Matte Black Revena Offset Door Pull is 13-1/2 inches in total length with 12 inch mounting centers. It is available in back to back mounting, thru-bolt mounting, or surface mounting. The Offset Matte Black 12 Inch Round Pull is made out of high quality stainless steel. It is easy to install and will fit most doors up to 3 inches thick. The Matte Black Revena Offset 12 Inch Door Handle has a round grip that is easy to care for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/24-inch-matte-black-revena-offset-door-pull\"><b>24 Revena Inch Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/36-inch-matte-black-revena-offset-door-pull\"><b>36 Revena Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Round Offset Doorware Designs RDOPULL12-622:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 13-1/4\" (337mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 12\" (305mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with removable round rosettes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RDOPULL12-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RDOPULL12 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Matte Black Revena Offset Door Pull",
                "description": "The Matte Black Revena Offset Door Pull is 13-1/2 inches in total length with 12 inch mounting centers. It is available in back to back mounting, thru-bolt mounting, or surface mounting. The Offset Matte Black 12 Inch Round Pull is made out of high quality stainless steel. It is easy to install and will fit most doors up to 3 inches thick. The Matte Black Revena Offset 12 Inch Door Handle has a round grip that is easy to care for.",
